WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A trace is evidence, not truth. Inspect agent activity without overstating what logs prove.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Bound the agent session.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Log tools, data and approvals.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Reconstruct sequence and state.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Separate observation from intent.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Escalate gaps before judging the outcome.
